  {
    "id": 67,
    "date": "2019-10-04T16:20:44+00:00",
    "from": "tour2020",
    "text": "On the road to Bristol, Ohio. Abandoned 2015, three stories and basement.  Old fat lady died. Had 15 or more dogs animal cages, absolutely revolting I could not stay or explore beyond this area. Would absolutely never sleep near the place. Bad feeling about the place probably haunted. Plenty of canned food for the apocalypse. Words cannot describe. Nightmarish scene in the heartland of the Amish farmers surrounding the place. Great investment, but bring in teams of men in protection gear to clean up the place. The Amish have no concern, and neither does anyone else around here. Surely the lady died there. Glad to get away from the place. Great place for urbex explorers.",
    "media": null
  },
